    "Debt is long-term debt outstanding plus short-term debt at year end.",
    "Political money is not scored: contributions to Wyoming city candidates were not loaded.",
    "Transparency practices have not been checked yet, so they are not scored.",
    "Cameras: 22 license-plate cameras are mapped inside Town of Jackson's borders in OpenStreetMap (22 made by Flock Safety), not counting cameras tagged as run by stores, malls, schools or state and regional agencies. Flock cameras count as a red flag whoever runs them. Other brands count only when the government is the recorded operator, since many have no operator recorded.",
    "Red flags: surveillance programs come from the EFF Atlas of Surveillance, a public database of news reports and public records, searched on 2026-10-18. A town or county with none listed may still have programs nobody has reported. Data center deals and corporate tax breaks have not been checked for Wyoming yet. Most records carry no dollar amount, so each documented program costs a quarter of the red-flag points instead of being counted as spending."
